<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1997/41/eng@/~cl_8__para_d> <https://schema.org/text> "by inserting after subparagraph 13(l)(c)(vi) the following subparagraphs: \"(vii) that the society has failed to comply with the provisions of section 2A; (viii) that the society has contravened the provisions of section 52; or (ix) that the society has failed to comply with the notice served by him under subsection (1) of section 16; and\";"@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1997/41/eng@> .
